    "title": "Delaware Boating Safety Class | Cape Gazette",
    "text": "Share:\nDelaware Boating Safety Class\nDelaware Boating Safety Class, registration 7:30 a.m., class 8 a.m. to 4 p.m., West Bay Community Center, 23719 Bayview Dr., Rehoboth Beach. Safe Boating Certificate to be mailed upon successful completion, cost is $20 per person, $50 for family with children under 18, materials provided, registration required. To register email flotilla1202@gmail.com or call 302-616-3175.\nEvent Details:\nEvent Date:\nSat, 04/25/2026 - 8:00am to 4:00pm",
